# Runtime map words.
#
# The map surface is implemented by VM/runtime primitives now:
#
#   map-new   ( -- map )
#   map-get   ( map key -- value found? )
#   map-has?  ( map key -- found? )
#   map-set   ( map key value -- map )
#   map-size  ( map -- size )
#
# `map-set` mutates the runtime map object and returns the same map. This is a
# deliberate performance-oriented difference from immutable arrays.
